---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Scavland System Requirements & PC Specs — Scavland Wiki" description="Official minimum and recommended PC system requirements for Scavland, Steam Deck compatibility, controller support, and performance settings." keywords="Scavland system requirements, Scavland PC specs, Scavland Steam Deck, Scavland controller support, minimum specs" canonical="/system-requirements/">
  <article class="article-shell">
    <header class="article-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Hardware Specifications · Updated August 31, 2026</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">System Requirements</h1>
      <p class="lede">Complete technical specifications required to run Scavland smoothly on PC, plus Steam Deck and controller optimization notes.</p>
      <span class="evidence">Evidence: Official Steam Hardware Specs</span>
    </header>

    <div class="article-layout">
      <div class="article-content">
        <h2 id="specs">Official PC Hardware Requirements</h2>

        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));gap:16px;margin:20px 0;">
          <div style="background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:20px;border-radius:4px;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--acid);font:700 1.4rem 'Barlow Condensed';text-transform:uppercase;">Minimum Requirements</h3>
            <ul style="padding-left:18px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink);margin:0;font-size:0.88rem;">
              <li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit</li>
              <li><strong>CPU:</strong> Intel Core i3-4160 / AMD FX-6300</li>
              <li><strong>RAM:</strong> 4 GB Memory</li>
              <li><strong>GPU:</strong> GTX 750 Ti / Radeon R7 260X (2 GB)</li>
              <li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li>
              <li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available SSD/HDD</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div style="background:var(--panel);border:1px solid #3f5c42;padding:20px;border-radius:4px;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--acid);font:700 1.4rem 'Barlow Condensed';text-transform:uppercase;">Recommended Requirements</h3>
            <ul style="padding-left:18px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink);margin:0;font-size:0.88rem;">
              <li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 64-bit</li>
              <li><strong>CPU:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K / Ryzen 5 1600</li>
              <li><strong>RAM:</strong> 8 GB Memory</li>
              <li><strong>GPU:</strong> GTX 1060 (6 GB) / Radeon RX 580 (8 GB)</li>
              <li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11 / 12</li>
              <li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB SSD (Recommended for fast loading)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 id="deck">Steam Deck &amp; Handheld Compatibility</h2>
        <p>Scavland is built on lightweight 2D pixel physics and optimized sprite rendering, making it exceptionally well-suited for portable handheld gaming:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Target Frame Rate:</strong> Stable 60 FPS on standard Steam Deck hardware without thermal throttling.</li>
          <li><strong>Battery Performance:</strong> Estimated 4.5+ hours of continuous wasteland exploration on a single charge.</li>
          <li><strong>UI &amp; Font Scaling:</strong> Dynamic UI scaling options ensure inventory tooltips and item stats remain sharp and readable on 7-inch/8-inch screens.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="article-media">
          <img src="/images/screenshots/steam_ss_05.webp" alt="Scavland inventory and item management interface" />
          <p class="caption">High-contrast inventory grid and item inspection interface designed for 1080p and handheld screens</p>
        </div>

        <h2 id="controls">Controller &amp; Mouse/Keyboard Support</h2>
        <p>Full gamepad support is natively supported with twin-stick aiming and customizable button layouts. Mouse &amp; keyboard precision remains fully supported for pixel-accurate sniping across the Mist.</p>

        <h2 id="next">Related Links</h2>
        <div class="related-grid">
          <a href="/release-date/"><strong>Release Schedule</strong><br/>Early Access launch times and content scope</a>
          <a href="/weapons/"><strong>Weapons Database</strong><br/>Firearm stats, attachments, and repair guides</a>
          <a href="/guide/scavland-beginner-guide/"><strong>Beginner Guide</strong><br/>First-run survival, safehouse stashing, and looting</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="toc" aria-label="On this page">
        <strong>On this page</strong>
        <a href="#specs">PC Hardware Specs</a>
        <a href="#deck">Steam Deck Support</a>
        <a href="#controls">Controls &amp; Gamepad</a>
        <a href="#next">Related Links</a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
